{"id":"n26697-1-10","stage":3,"title":"운반 · 运输","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26697-1-10-1","ko":"삼촌, 이삿짐 다 쌌어요. 생각보다 짐이 많지 않네요.","zh":"叔叔，搬家用的东西都收拾好了。东西没想象中那么多呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼촌,","meaning":"叔叔，舅舅","explanation":"삼촌：叔叔，舅舅","readings":[{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61142","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}},{"text":"이삿짐","meaning":"搬家的东西","explanation":"이삿짐：搬家的东西","readings":[{"term":"이삿짐","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71996","senseId":"1","lemma":"이삿짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이삿짐","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全、都","explanation":"다：全、都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"쌌어요.","meaning":"装，打包","explanation":"싸다：装，打包；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65049","senseId":"3","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌌어요","audio":"/audio/7cbb9935f0713c1e8585.mp3"}},{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"想法，展望","explanation":"생각：想法，展望；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"6","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각보다","audio":"/audio/60c489add64a605ce212.mp3"}},{"text":"짐이","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐이","audio":"/audio/add0f4fadc4e9cc274b8.mp3"}},{"text":"많지","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많지","audio":"/audio/138e393ff7bf34821d66.mp3"}},{"text":"않네요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않네요","audio":"/audio/042cabd29a00026f1220.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5d1a410b7ca871d4","term":"삼촌","zh":"叔叔，舅舅","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3","entryId":"61142","definition":"用于指称或称呼父母的兄弟。","pronunciation":["삼촌"]},{"id":"2ad758f1225008c2","term":"이삿짐","zh":"搬家的东西","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3","entryId":"71996","definition":"搬家时搬运的行李。","pronunciation":["이사찜","이삳찜"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全、都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"全、都","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"装，打包","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"65049","definition":"为了将某个东西运往别处而用箱子、绳子或布等包起来。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，展望","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想象今后将要发生的事；或指那种想象。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/394d3d96d76ff57fac44.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26697-1-10-2","ko":"그래, 수고했다. 이제 운반만 하면 되겠구나.","zh":"很好，辛苦了。现在只要再搬运一下就行了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"수고했다.","meaning":"辛苦，受累","explanation":"수고하다：辛苦，受累；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"수고하다","audio":"/audio/94259891bb90f3e1cd5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64031","senseId":"1","lemma":"수고하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수고했다","audio":"/audio/a3f93ad6009aa0844e67.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"운반만","meaning":"运输，运送","explanation":"운반：运输，运送；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"운반","audio":"/audio/8721afdd59426e7d8198.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26697","senseId":"1","lemma":"운반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운반만","audio":"/audio/3437968f1cb901d2b2b1.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠구나.","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠구나","audio":"/audio/621d5b92f064bdf4dc3e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"94259891bb90f3e1","term":"수고하다","zh":"辛苦，受累","audio":"/audio/94259891bb90f3e1cd5d.mp3","entryId":"64031","definition":"做某事时用心费力。","pronunciation":["수ː고하다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"8721afdd59426e7d","term":"운반","zh":"运输，运送","audio":"/audio/8721afdd59426e7d8198.mp3","entryId":"26697","definition":"搬运货物等。","pronunciation":["운ː반"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利，不错","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"事情发展得很好。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/443409dfdeeb94f3fdb6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.213,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26697","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0397,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["叔叔，搬家用的东西都收拾好了。东西没想象中那么多呢。","很好，辛苦了。现在只要再搬运一下就行了。","这袋零食多少钱？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["叔叔，搬家用的东西都收拾好了。东西没想象中那么多呢。","很好，辛苦了。现在只要再搬运一下就行了。","这袋零食多少钱？"],"answer":1}]}
